# What must not go into the image.
#
# The working tree carries roughly 2.5G of build output — compiled Solidity, Next
# bundles, turbo's cache, and every market generated during development. None of it is
# input to the build, all of it would be uploaded to the builder, and the generated jobs
# in particular are other people's markets.

node_modules
**/node_modules

# Build output, all of which is regenerated inside the image.
.next
**/.next
out
**/out
dist
**/dist
.turbo
**/.turbo

# Foundry's artefacts and its cache. The vendored sources are kept; these are not.
packages/contracts/out
packages/contracts/cache
packages/contracts/broadcast

# Generated markets. Runtime state, held on a volume rather than baked in.
generated

.git
.github
.vercel
.railway
.research
.proof
docs
assets

**/.env
**/.env.local
**/*.log
.DS_Store
